    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One‑Quarter Tank Fuel Regulation</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Fill the tank to 25% capacity, seal the filler cap, and secure the fuel gauge. This standardised level minimizes fire risk and complies with safety regulations for all modes of transport—be it a BTM layout on a dedicated bike transport route or a rail carriage.</p>
