      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transportation Sankeshwar Secure</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Transporting a motorbike from Sankeshwar requires meticulous preparation to ensure a seamless and secure journey. Whether you are relocating or shipping for personal use, having the correct documentation ready is the first critical step. The most fundamental requirement is a <strong>self-attested photocopy of the Registration Certificate (RC)</strong>.</p>
<p>This document proves legal ownership and must be clearly legible. Ensure that your name matches the one on the RC to avoid any customs or transport authority delays at the destination.</p>

<p>In addition to ownership proof, you must provide a <strong>current Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate</strong>. This confirms that your vehicle meets the environmental emission standards set by the government. An expired PUC can lead to immediate rejection of your shipment by logistics providers.</p>
<p>Furthermore, a <strong>valid insurance certificate</strong> for the bike itself is mandatory before it can be loaded onto the transport vehicle. This ensures that the vehicle is covered against third-party liability and basic damages while in the custody of the transporter prior to the specific transit coverage being applied.</p>

<p>The most crucial logistical document is the <strong>IBA-approved consignment bilty</strong>. This is the official shipping invoice issued by the carrier. It contains detailed information about the sender, receiver, vehicle description, and the agreed-upon freight charges.</p>
<p>Both parties should verify all details on the bilty before the shipment commences. This document serves as the legal contract between you and the transport company, outlining terms, conditions, and liability limits.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">While the basic insurance covers the vehicle's static status, the transit phase requires specialized protection.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>It is highly recommended to opt for <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Unlike standard policies that may have deductibles or coverage caps, marine transit insurance specifically protects against risks inherent to road and rail movement, such as accidents, theft, fire, or natural calamities during the journey.</span></li></ul>
<p>By choosing 100% declared-value coverage, you ensure that if any damage occurs, the compensation matches the full market value of your bike, providing complete financial peace of mind. This comprehensive approach to documentation and insurance minimizes stress and guarantees that your valuable asset arrives safely and legally at its destination in Sankeshwar or beyond.</p>

